  "term": "intellectualism",
  "definition": "Intellectualism is the view that thinking or knowing is the most basic mental function, with feeling and will explained in terms of it. In philosophy, it also means the view that thought or reason is the ultimate principle of reality, or that reality can be fully understood by thought.",
